00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,369
B. Clausius is the refrigerator statement: no self acting device can move heat from cold to hot.

2
00:00:07,369 --> 00:00:12,799
Option A is also forbidden by the second law, but that is the Kelvin Planck statement.

3
00:00:12,799 --> 00:00:17,356
Turning work into heat, as friction does, is always allowed.

